{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/eng_titulo0.gif?t=1743688576\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Din Dino, the mob's top ex-hitman, runs away from their past to pursue their true passion: <strong>selling custom t-shirts</strong>. It's a new start, a new life. But escaping won't be so easy. Their boss, Al Sapone, shows up and demands that they pay a huge debt if they want to buy their freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will Din Dino go back to their shady ways in order to keep their new life? And why is running a crappy t-shirt store so important to them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/eng_titulo1.gif?t=1743688576\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play cozy minigames and make full use of your sticker arsenal to create textile masterpieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/Gameplay02.gif?t=1743688576\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/eng_titulo3.gif?t=1743688576\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find out  your clients' tastes, and you might learn something new about them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/Gameplay01.gif?t=1743688576\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/eng_titulo2.gif?t=1743688576\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face against shadowy figures from Din Dino's past in a wide variety of situations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/Gameplay03.gif?t=1743688576\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/eng_titulo4.gif?t=1743688576\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You decide if you'd prefer running a clean business or hiding some dirty laundry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/eng_titulo5.gif?t=1743688576\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a story with multiple endings, based on your decisions and reputation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design t-shirts for your customers, with many unique sticker designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new stickers and upgrade your t-shirt making machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive each day, overcome your confrontations with the mafia and repay your debt.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3082440?t=1743688576","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743688576","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743688576","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743688576","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a